# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.

# --- Supabase ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL: your project URL, e.g. https://<ref>.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: the anon / publishable key (sb_publishable_...).
# Both are public (they ship in the browser bundle); Row Level Security protects data.
# Without these the app runs as an anonymous prototype: sync says "on this device
# only" and /verify/<id> says verification is unavailable. Nothing is faked.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Server-only. Bypasses RLS, never expose to the browser (currently unused).
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# --- That is the whole list. ---
# Everything else this file used to carry is gone with the feature that needed it:
#   ANALYSIS_SERVICE_URL   — the in-house satellite service was deleted (PARKED.md).
#   CRON_SECRET            — the monitoring sweep cron was deleted.
#   ALERT_WEBHOOK_SECRET   — standing monitoring was deleted.
#   ACOUSTIC_INGEST_TOKEN  — the acoustic ingest route was deleted.
#
# The GROW lane needs no keys at all: Open-Meteo requires none, and the tea
# classifier runs in the browser from a static file in public/models/.
